    "description": {
      "content": "DefiLlama is the largest open-source DeFi TVL and yield aggregator. The public REST API at api.llama.fi exposes TVL, prices, stablecoins, yields, DEX/options volumes, fees, and revenue datasets without authentication. The Pro API at pro-api.llama.fi provides higher rate limits and additional endpoints under a paid plan.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: DefiLlama",
